==English==

===Etymology===
[[RAS syndrome]]; "PIN number" is a [[pleonasm]] as the "N" of "PIN" stands for "number".

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈpɪn.nʌm.bɝ/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-PIN number.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A common alternative form of '''[[PIN]]''' (in the sense of "personal identification number").

====Usage notes====
* It is avoided by some speaker due to the redundancy of saying "personal identification number number."

